<title>ITALY: Italy tax revenue up 8.4 pct Jan-Oct 96.</title>
<headline>Italy tax revenue up 8.4 pct Jan-Oct 96.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's tax revenue rose 8.4 percent to 402.109 trillion lire in the first 10 months of 1996 compared to the same period in 1995, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>Last month, the Bank of Italy estimated that tax revenue in the first 11 months of 1996 had risen 6.9 percent to 423.759 trillion lire. -- Rome newsroom +396-678-2501</p>
